        "name": "vpa",
        "namespace": "vpa-system",
        "repo": "https://kubernetes.github.io/autoscaler",
        "type": "helm",
        "values": "# The chart sets no container context and no seccomp profile; the namespace enforces Pod Security restricted.\npodSecurityContext:\n  runAsNonRoot: true\n  runAsUser: 65534\n  seccompProfile: {type: RuntimeDefault}\n# Pod Security restricted requires both settings.\ncontainerSecurityContext:\n  allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n  capabilities: {drop: [ALL]}\nrecommender:\n  # Produces suggestions from metrics.k8s.io.\n  enabled: true\n  # Pinned by digest; a tag alone can move.\n  image:\n    repository: registry.k8s.io/autoscaling/vpa-recommender\n    tag: 1.8.1@sha256:edf874b830984d1df9d60f839874eba42de3465051922b929754edc42ea0f69b\nupdater:\n  # Evicts pods to apply suggestions; keep changes manual.\n  enabled: false\nadmissionController:\n  # Rewrites pod resources at admission; same reason.\n  enabled: false\n",
        "version": "0.15.0"
      }
    ],
    "requires": [
      {
        "component": "metrics-server"
      }
    ],
    "security": {
      "podSecurity": "restricted",
      "summary": "Reads pods, workloads and metrics in all namespaces; writes VPA status."
    }
